  "body": "## What changed\nAdded the `camcraft_post::kinematics` module in `crates/post/src/kinematics/`.\nImplemented `forward_machine` and `forward_part` using Rodrigues axis-angle rotation with configurable rotary axes, offsets, work datum, and rotary sign conventions.\nImplemented `AcSolver` and `analytical_branches` to evaluate both `(+A, C)` and `(-A, C + 180 deg)` branches against `A.travel` and `C.travel`.\nAdded modal `C` holding inside `pole_sin_tol` near `A = 0` and weighted angular step minimization across branches for smooth zero crossings.\nAdded continuous `C` unwrapping inside sections, safe-retract re-wrapping, named refusals for invalid geometry or travel overflow, and quarter-point chord subdivision in `solve_path` and `solve_toolpath`.\nExported `kinematics` in `crates/post/src/lib.rs`, added tests in `crates/post/tests/ac_trunnion_ik.rs` and `crates/post/src/kinematics/tests.rs`, and recorded the design decision in `docs/decisions/1965-ac-trunnion-ik.md`.\n\n## Cause\nThe codebase lacked a shared pure-Rust XYZAC table-table inverse kinematics solver in `camcraft-post`, so machine checking and post processors had no common kinematic core for off-pivot offsets, rotary branch selection, pole holding, continuous C unwrapping, and chord subdivision.\n\n## Tests\n- Pins (`cargo test -p camcraft-post --test ac_trunnion_ik`): 7 passed (`round_trip_fk_ik_with_nonzero_offsets_within_micron`, `asymmetric_a_limits_select_reachable_branch_and_refuse_unreachable`, `pole_near_zero_holds_previous_modal_c_instead_of_snapping_to_zero`, `smooth_crossing_of_a_zero_without_180_deg_c_flip`, `continuous_c_unwrapping_and_safe_retract_rewrapping`, `subdivides_linear_moves_beyond_chord_tolerance_for_tip_accuracy`, `refuses_malformed_machine_geometry_and_non_finite_inputs`).\n- Unit tests (`cargo test -p camcraft-post --lib kinematics`): 4 passed (`rollover_wraps_into_0_to_360_at_initial_and_safe_retract`, `positive_only_a_limits_reorient_c_at_pole_within_chord_tolerance`, `solve_toolpath_converts_cl_moves_and_detects_retract`, `refuses_non_positive_path_options_and_parallel_spindle`).\n- Full crate suite (`cargo test -p camcraft-post`): all lib unit and integration suites passed before the final `solve.rs`/`travel.rs` extraction, and `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` plus `cargo clippy -p camcraft-post --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed on the final tree.\n- Mutation checks on `ac_trunnion_ik`:\n  - Removed `pub mod kinematics;` in `crates/post/src/lib.rs`: failed compile -> restored -> passed.\n  - Replaced modal `C` hold at pole with `0.0` in `solve.rs`: `pole_near_zero_holds_previous_modal_c_instead_of_snapping_to_zero` and `smooth_crossing_of_a_zero_without_180_deg_c_flip` failed -> restored -> passed.\n  - Disabled weighted minimum-cost branch selection in `solve.rs`: `smooth_crossing_of_a_zero_without_180_deg_c_flip` failed (`dC=180`) -> restored -> passed.\n  - Replaced strict `unwrap_near` + `C.travel` refusal in `Continuous` mode with re-wrap turn search in `solve.rs`: `continuous_c_unwrapping_and_safe_retract_rewrapping` failed -> restored -> passed.\n  - Disabled `exceeds_chord_tol` check in `path.rs`: `subdivides_linear_moves_beyond_chord_tolerance_for_tip_accuracy` failed (`got 1` segment) -> restored -> passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone (`git diff --stat 17a8c6e7 -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\nWiring `.mch` trunnion schema fields (#1962), `mach4.cps` posting (#1968), `G93` inverse-time feeds (#1966), and `machine::check_ops` integration (#1969) remain out of scope for those downstream issues.\n\n## Overlaps\nNone on `crates/post/src/lib.rs`, `crates/post/src/kinematics/`, `crates/post/tests/ac_trunnion_ik.rs`, or `docs/decisions/1965-ac-trunnion-ik.md`.\n\nChangelog: Added pure-Rust AC table-table forward/inverse kinematics solver and chord subdivider in `camcraft-post`.\nFixes #1965\n",
